    "UNMEASURED": "in scope and settleable in principle; no measurement has been run. A first-class state.",
    "UNCHECKABLE": "no public evidence can settle it. A statement about the evidence, never about the subject."
  },
  "selection_criteria": "Subjects are selected where a public claim is (a) specific enough to capture verbatim and (b) about infrastructure a third party relies on. Selection is published because a selection rule is the one place an agenda can hide (spec 10.3).",
